###############################################
# FILE:     BIGTOK.PAT (pass 0)
# SUBJ:     Automatically generated RFA file.
# AUTH:     VisualText
# CREATED:  Fri Nov 05 21:37:45 1999
# MODIFIED: 
# NOTE:     
